Choose among thousands of properties in the United Arab Emirates. We can be your guide to the real estate market in the UAE. Our team has collected the best flats, apartments, villas, townhouses, and penthouses from developers and real estate agencies in Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Sharjah, and other cities. You will easily find your dream home with us. Buy, sell, rent, or invest in the real estate market with Emirates.Estate.


FEATURES

We connect you with various real estate and construction companies from the different emirates to choose the best property in the UAE at affordable prices. Found a property you like? Reach out to the listing agent via phone, email, WhatsApp, Viber, or Telegram straight from our mobile app.


Search


We offer you several options for finding UAE real estate: both simple and advanced. Set up search filters, choose the type of deal, the type of property, the number of bedrooms, the price range, and the region.


Filters


With custom filters, you can choose the status of the property, the number of rooms, number of bathrooms, the living space, the floor area, the number of floors in the building, the distance to the sea, to the airport, the presence of a swimming pool, terrace, or parking, elevators and much more. Select from a wide range of property types from apartments to townhouses, penthouses, and villas in the United Arab Emirates.


Property details


Find all the important information about the property on one page including the general description, the images, the number of bedrooms, the features of the property, the area, the indoor and outdoor facilities, the location, the price, and much more.


Map search


Do you prefer to choose a property using a map? Use our Map search to navigate around a neighborhood, and see the number of listings per building, or just check out the properties that are around you.


Save to wishlist


Create your own list of favorite properties so as not to lose sight of them with the help of a convenient feature – Save to Wishlist.


Compare


You can easily compare property listings in our app using the comparison option. Just add a few properties by clicking on “Compare” and we will display all the differences between two apartments, villas, or other real estate.


Offer your price


If you think the cost of real estate is too high, you can always make your own offer. Our agents will process the application and contact you to discuss the terms of the transaction.



TYPES OF LISTINGS
Find thousands of offers on the UAE real estate market, in our app you can find the following types of property listings:
- Apartments;
- Rooms;
- Villas;
- Townhouses;
- Penthouses;
- Condos;
- Duplexes/Triplexes;
- Lofts;
- Land plots;
- Commercial property (offices, warehouses, shops, buildings);
- Off-plan property;
and etc.



BUY, SELL or RENT
Our property finder service ensures everything our customers may need:
- The very latest property offers from trusted developers, real estate agents, and property owners;
- One of the largest property databases in the United Arab Emirates;
- A user-friendly property search with separate parameter filters;
- The latest market news and statistics, guides, and reviews, and other useful information;
- Professional real estate advice.

Emirates.Estate will help you find and buy the best property in Dubai from a trusted seller.


LOCATIONS

